    <detaileddescription>
<para>k-based turbulent viscosity wall function boundary condition.</para>
<para>Known limitations:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Single-patch-corner only: each wall cell is assumed to see at most one wall-function face. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
